      "title": "Career@UM – University of Macau",
      "description": "Career@UM – University of Macau Skip to content Search for: Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Job Vacancy with List benwong Wong Kin Man 2026-08-03T18:16:57+08:00 WELCOME TO CAREER@UM The University of Macau (UM) is a comprehensive research-oriented public university of international standing in the Macao Special Administrative Region, which is located in the western part of the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area (GBA), one of the world’s fastest-growing hubs for technology and innovation. UM is ranked 145th in the Times Higher Education World University Rankings and 267th in the QS World University Rankings. With a scenic campus of approximately 1 km 2 on Hengqin island, UM has achieved significant progress in the past decade as evidenced by its rising international repute, state-of-the-art teaching and research facilities, and the establishment of three State Key Laboratories in microelectronics, Chinese medicine, and internet of things for smart city. Committed to supporting Macao’s economic diversification and the development of the Guangdong-Macao In-Depth Cooperation Zone in Hengqin, UM actively advances frontier research and develops interdisciplinary programmes in a range of strategic areas, including precision oncology, advanced materials, regional oceanography, artificial intelligence and robotics, data science, cognitive and brain science, and economics and finance. Leveraging its ‘4-in-1’ model of education and residential college system, UM provides all-round undergraduate education, nurturing talent to support social and economic development of Macao and the wider GBA. As part of its continued development, UM is establishing a new campus in the Cooperation Zone in Hengqin, setting the stage for the university to become the first higher education institution in Macao to extend operations into the Cooperation Zone. Scheduled to commence operations in 2028, the Cooperation Zone campus will usher in the ‘one university, two campuses’ model, further strengthening UM’s capacity for teaching and research. With unprecedented growth and development, UM offers a wide range of opportunities for high-calibre talents at all levels to achieve their career goals. The university uses English as its working language and primary medium of instruction. Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors Gallery Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors College Master Gallery College Master College Master Dean of Faculty of Design Gallery Dean of Faculty of Design Dean of Faculty of Design Dean of Faculty of Engineering Gallery Dean of Faculty of Engineering Dean of Faculty of Engineering Dean of Faculty of Medicine Gallery Dean of Faculty of Medicine Dean of Faculty of Medicine Dean of Faculty of Science Gallery Dean of Faculty of Science Dean of Faculty of Science Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Gallery Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Head of Department of Communication Gallery Head of Department of Communication Head of Department of Communication Head of Department of Portuguese Gallery Head of Department of Portuguese Head of Department of Portuguese Job Search Units: Positions: Categories: Nothing selected Academic Staff Administrative Staff Research Staff Nothing selected Academic Staff Administrative Staff Research Staff Reference no.: Units Positions Categories Reference no. Release Date Close Date INSTITUTE OF APPLIED PHYSICS AND MATERIALS ENGINEERING Full/Associate/Assistant Professor in Materials Science and Engineering Academic Staff IAPME/FAAP/08/2026 2026-08-28 until filled FACULTY OF ARTS AND HUMANITIES Senior Administrative Assistant/Administrative Assistant for the Faculty of Arts and Humanities Administrative Staff FAH/SAA/AA/08/2026 2026-08-28 2026-09-10 FACULTY OF ARTS AND H