      "description": "Learn More – Career@UM Skip to content Search for: Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Learn More ensonho Ho Io San 2021-02-11T12:08:00+08:00 GET FAMILIAR WITH UM AND MACAO This webpage aims at providing some basic information for candidates to understand more about the University of Macau (UM) and Macao before joining us. Conditions not specified in this page are covered by the University’s Charter, Personnel Statute, and the related internal regulations and rules. ACADEMIC APPOINTEES TERMS OF APPOINTMENT SUBSIDIES LEAVES STAFF BENEFITS ADMINISTRATIVE APPOINTEES TERMS OF APPOINTMENT SUBSIDIES LEAVES STAFF BENEFITS LIVE IN MACAO ABOUT MACAO EDUCATION HEALTH CARE Last Modified: 11 February 2021 This site is best viewed in Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Safari or Microsoft Edge. Copyright © Office of Administration (ADMO). All rights reserved.    | UM Home | UM News | UM Event Calendar Page load link Go to Top"
