 Scheduled to commence operations in 2028, the Cooperation Zone campus will usher in the ‘one university, two campuses’ model, further strengthening UM’s capacity for teaching and research. With unprecedented growth and development, UM offers a wide range of opportunities for high-calibre talents at all levels to achieve their career goals. The university uses English as its working language and primary medium of instruction. Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors Gallery Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors Chair Professors and Distinguished Professors College Master Gallery College Master College Master Dean of Faculty of Design Gallery Dean of Faculty of Design Dean of Faculty of Design Dean of Faculty of Engineering Gallery Dean of Faculty of Engineering Dean of Faculty of Engineering Dean of Faculty of Medicine Gallery Dean of Faculty of Medicine Dean of Faculty of Medicine Dean of Faculty of Science Gallery Dean of Faculty of Science Dean of Faculty of Science Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Gallery Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Head of Department of Clinical Medicine Head of Department of Communication Gallery Head of Department of Communication Head of Department of Communication Head of Department of Portuguese Gallery Head of Department of Portuguese Head of Department of Portuguese Job Search Units: Positions: Categories: Nothing selected Academic Staff Administrative Staff Research Staff Nothing selected Academic Staff Administrative Staff Research Staff Reference no.: Units Positions Categories Reference no. Release Date Close Date INSTITUTE OF APPLIED PHYSICS AND MATERIALS ENGINEERING Full/Associate/Assistant Professor in Materials Science and Engineering Academic Staff IAPME/FAAP/08/2026 2026-08-28 until filled FACULTY OF ARTS AND HUMANITIES Senior Administrative Assistant/Administrative Assistant for the Faculty of Arts and Humanities Administrative Staff FAH/SAA/AA/08/2026 2026-08-28 2026-09-10 FACULTY OF ARTS AND H