    "https://career.admo.um.edu.mo/feg_rp_08_2026/": {
      "title": "Research Positions in the Faculty of Engineering",
      "description": "Research Positions in the Faculty of Engineering – Career@UM Skip to content Search for: Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Home Login Career Page Career Opportunities Learn More Contact Us ENG 中文 Research Positions in the Faculty of Engineering Apply for this job now Research Positions in the Faculty of Engineering Engineering (Reference No.: FEG/RP/08/2026) Research Staff The Faculty of Engineering (FEG) invites applications for the position of research personnel in the following areas: Biomedical Engineering, Civil and Environmental Engineering, Electrical and Computer Engineering, Electromechanical Engineering, Materials Science and Engineering, Ocean Science and Technology and related disciplines. Initial appointment is up to 12 months with a possibility of renewal upon mutual agreement and funding availability. As part of a strategic expansion, UM recently established five science and technology faculties through the restructuring of part of its existing faculties. In which, the FEG is committed to becoming an internationally leading center for engineering education and technological innovation, the most influential base for cultivating new engineering talents on the west bank of the Greater Bay Area, a technological engine for the moderate diversification of Macao’s economy, and a platform for engineering and technological exchange connecting China and the world, contributing to national scientific and technological innovation and industrial development. UM is among the top 0.1% in ESI (Essential Sciences Indicators) rankings in Engineering. The Engineering Subject of UM is ranked in the 101–125 bracket in the THE World University Rankings. The selected candidate is expected to assume duty as soon as possible. Qualifications Visiting Fellows: A doctoral degree and professional rank at Associate Professor or above in related disciplines; a solid research record and expertise. Postdoctoral Fellows: A doctoral degree in related disciplines; a solid record of publication and scientific training. Research Assistants: A bachelor’s degree or above in related disciplines, with relevant research and/or project experience. Remuneration Remuneration and appointment rank offered will be commensurate with the successful applicants’ academic qualification and relevant professional experience. The current local maximum income tax rate is 12% but is effectively around 5% – 7% after various discretionary exemptions. Application Procedure Applicants should visit https://career.admo.um.edu.mo/ for more details and apply ONLINE . Review of applications will continue until the positions are filled. Applicants may consider their applications not successful if they are not invited for an interview within 3 months of application. Human Resources Section, Office of Administration University of Macau, Av. da Universidade, Taipa, Macau, China Website: https://career.admo.um.edu.mo/ ; Email: vacancy@um.edu.mo Tel: +853 8822 8574; Fax: +853 8822 2412 The University of Macau reserves the right not to appoint a candidate. ***Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only*** ** Under the equal condition of qualifications and experience, priority will be given to Macao permanent residents** Word document Word document (zip) PDF (view with Acrobat Reader) Download the application form only when applying through this online system is not likely. When not applying through this website, besides completing the application form, please submit your CV, copy of academic certificates (diplomas), ID or passport copy and declaration of employment (for civil servant only) to the above postal address, e-mail address or fax no. Click here to download the Acrobat Reader alisonwong Wong Weng I 2026-09-03T23:42:31+08:00 This site is best viewed in Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Safari or Microsoft Edge. Copyright © Office of Administration (ADMO). All rights reserved.    | UM Home | UM News | UM Event Calendar Page load link Go to Top"
